s/30118761/godot.txt)\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Enable Page Heap for `godot.windows.editor.x86_64.exe` using GFlags (`/full`).\n2. Launch the Godot editor.\n3. Open the scan dialog.\n4. Start the scan.\n5. Close the dialog.\n6. The editor crashes with an Access Violation\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nn/a","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121493/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121493/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}